OL,3,GNEWSAMum faces heart transplant wait
OL,4,Afar from home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother says it is "awful" to be
OL,7,Fseparated from her family as she waits
OL,8,Ffor a heart transplant 150 miles
OL,9,F(240km) from home.
OL,11,FCharlotte Gibbs, who lives on the
OL,12,Foutskirts of Bristol, has already spent
OL,13,Fthree weeks in hospital in Cambridge,
OL,14,Fwith her family making a seven-hour
OL,15,Fround trip each weekend to see her.
OL,17,FThe mother-of-two said: "They're
OL,18,Fexhausted. Two nights is the longest I
OL,19,Fhave ever spent away from them since
OL,20,Fthey were born."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
